m-based VR movement\n\nImmersive horror environments\n\nIntelligent enemy AI\n\nIntense chase sequences\n\nDesigned for standalone Quest\n\nYou are not trapped.\nYou are not safe.\nAnd it hears everything.", "short_description": "A terrifying VR horror experience using full arm-based movement. Run, climb, and escape through dark environments while something hunts you."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/Estherhalkyard-boop/tree_climberss-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "sammy9095", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/Estherhalkyard-boop/tree_climberss-privacy-policy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26185085604464851"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3787887918174748"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3787887918174748"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1772036100, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3787887918174748"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26213781101595301", "version": "6"}, "id": "936248208788887", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"no